[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10740.63, "timestamp": "02:59:00", "text": "可以从六月中旬开始，而且看起来会是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10744.95, "timestamp": "02:59:04", "text": "到七月底就结束了，我就想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10747.75, "timestamp": "02:59:07", "text": "我也想这么做，但我又没钱了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10752.61, "timestamp": "02:59:12", "text": "没钱。是啊。哦，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10753.83, "timestamp": "02:59:13", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10755.03, "timestamp": "02:59:15", "text": "就是这样。哦，那会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10757.349, "timestamp": "02:59:17", "text": "效果非常好。就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10758.79, "timestamp": "02:59:18", "text": "尤其是因为他们就像在工作一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10760.63, "timestamp": "02:59:20", "text": "如果能这样安排，那就太理想了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10762.63, "timestamp": "02:59:22", "text": "正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10765.59, "timestamp": "02:59:25", "text": "是的。他们俩之前都有过工作经历。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10767.67, "timestamp": "02:59:27", "text": "这就是我选择他们的原因。我放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10770.469, "timestamp": "02:59:30", "text": "把他们放到群组私信里，这样他们就可以了。就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10773.03, "timestamp": "02:59:33", "text": "对他们来说会更容易。索具工"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10775.83, "timestamp": "02:59:35", "text": "就像帮助艺术家一样，因为感觉就像我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10778.63, "timestamp": "02:59:38", "text": "他们的第一个孩子。我猜她还没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10783.11, "timestamp": "02:59:43", "text": "之前做过一些与 YouTuber 相关的艺术作品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10785.11, "timestamp": "02:59:45", "text": "她更像是一幅插画。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10788.87, "timestamp": "02:59:48", "text": "插画家。所以，是的，她确实喜欢你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10791.67, "timestamp": "02:59:51", "text": "那些艺术家，对吧？人声"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10794.63, "timestamp": "02:59:54", "text": "歌手。是的。是的。是的。她做了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10797.67, "timestamp": "02:59:57", "text": "背景和类似音乐视频的东西"}]